    {
      "id": "claim_fc801a2e1e25452d8a3817f790b4e119",
      "statement": "AGENTS.md elevates the security boundaries to non-negotiable invariants and requires an ADR before implementing any change that alters authentication, authorization, privacy, storage, a trust boundary, or browser routing/targeting/lifecycle semantics; it also prohibits continuous streaming, background surveillance, cookie export, credential extraction, session cloning, and MFA interception.",
